scenario: DISK-INSTALL-01
title: Install to the internal disk
area: Install
rows: F-STORE-04, F-INST-06
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A computer whose disk may be erased, started from the stick, with the power connected.
step: Start the install and choose whole-disk mode.
expect: The plan names the disk, its size and what will be erased, and asks you to confirm.
clause: F-INST-06.plan
step: Confirm and wait for the install to finish.
expect: A message says the install is done and asks you to remove the stick.
clause: F-STORE-04.done
step: Remove the stick and restart.
expect: IYAKKI starts from the internal disk and shows the first-start or sign-in screen.
clause: F-STORE-04.boot
